<title>USA: Department 56 Inc Q1 net down.</title>
<headline>Department 56 Inc Q1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			  8,723		   12,157</p>
<p> Revs			45,729		   58,996</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the quarter, excluding a duty refund of $370,000, was $8.5 million, or $0.39 per share, compared to $12.0 million, excluding a duty refund of $200,000, or $0.55 per share, in the prior year.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
